              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">ML & AI Integration</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3">
            On-device ML, LLM integration, and production AI pipelines.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-1">
            <li>• CoreML, MLX, ONNX</li>
            <li>• LLM API integration</li>
            <li>• Custom model deployment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div
          class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400"
              fill="none"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke="currentColor"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
