            Scalable APIs and cloud infrastructure with Go, Rust, and TypeScript.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-1">
            <li>• API design & development</li>
            <li>• CI/CD optimization</li>
            <li>• Cloud deployment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Track Record Section -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Track Record</h2>
